# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @OWNER with the person who owns the
# architecture. A PR that touches one of these paths waits for them; anything else
# merges once its required checks pass, because the architecture it implements was
# approved in its spec. Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for main.

# Work starts, and the architecture is set, here.
/intent/*/intent.md @OWNER
/intent/*/spec.md @OWNER

# The gates themselves, so a build can't loosen what checks it.
/.github/ @OWNER
/REVIEW.md @OWNER
/.claude/settings.json @OWNER
/.claude/checks.json @OWNER
bands.yaml @OWNER

# Architecture definitions: LikeC4 models, and each boundary configuration file
# (for example the file that holds an import-boundary tool's rules).
*.c4 @OWNER
